{
  "description": "Labelled operational instructions for evaluating instruction interpretation. Synthetic, written by the project author. 'dev' items were used while developing the deterministic parser; 'test' items were written afterwards and the parser was not tuned on them. 'expected' lists only the fields stated by the operator; omitted fields take the documented defaults (objective=minimize_cost, qos_level=standard, allow_capacity_reduction=true). Times are minutes since 00:00 of the simulated day; windows are [start_minute, end_minute).",
